    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>Venomous</strong>, a 2D action-adventure game where precision and strategy take center stage. Play as Venomous, a skilled warrior armed with web-slinging abilities, sharp slashes, and accurate shuriken throws. Navigate beautifully crafted levels, overcome challenging enemies, and engage in thrilling boss battles as you fight to restore balance to your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its focus on thoughtful gameplay, <i>Venomous</i> offers a rewarding experience for players who value skillful combat and exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat System</strong>: Combine web-slinging, slashing, and shuriken attacks to take down enemies with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Progression</strong>: Unlock milestones and showcase your mastery as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>Venomous</strong>, a 2D action-adventure game where precision and strategy take center stage. Play as Venomous, a skilled warrior armed with web-slinging abilities, sharp slashes, and accurate shuriken throws. Navigate beautifully crafted levels, overcome challenging enemies, and engage in thrilling boss battles as you fight to restore balance to your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its focus on thoughtful gameplay, <i>Venomous</i> offers a rewarding experience for players who value skillful combat and exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat System</strong>: Combine web-slinging, slashing, and shuriken attacks to take down enemies with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements &amp; Progression</strong>: Unlock milestones and showcase your mastery as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
